00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:14,740
(Watch on KonFlix.vip)

1
00:01:46,985 --> 00:01:49,585
Traces of an anesthetic were detected
in the victim's blood.

2
00:01:50,225 --> 00:01:52,705
A distinct injection mark on the neck.

3
00:01:52,785 --> 00:01:55,345
Multiple signs of struggle on the limbs.

4
00:01:55,425 --> 00:01:57,385
The surface of the body
shows a cherry-red color.

5
00:01:57,465 --> 00:01:59,105
That's the typical sign of death
caused by hypothermia.

6
00:01:59,905 --> 00:02:04,425
In other words,
Mei got into a fight with someone.

7
00:02:04,505 --> 00:02:07,225
During the struggle,
he was injected with an anesthetic

8
00:02:07,825 --> 00:02:09,065
before being stuffed into the freezer.

9
00:02:10,425 --> 00:02:11,585
Time of death?

10
00:02:11,665 --> 00:02:12,665
Around four weeks ago.

11
00:02:12,745 --> 00:02:14,145
Four weeks ago?

12
00:02:15,305 --> 00:02:16,745
Only one student
went missing at that time.

13
00:02:16,825 --> 00:02:19,985
The other four students
weren't taken by Mei.

14
00:02:21,945 --> 00:02:24,305
Could he have had an accomplice?

15
00:02:24,385 --> 00:02:26,865
Maybe they argued over something,

16
00:02:26,945 --> 00:02:28,425
then the accomplice killed him

17
00:02:28,505 --> 00:02:30,145
and kept using the old method
to continue the crimes.

18
00:02:34,865 --> 00:02:39,145
JUNE 10TH, 2015, REPORT FILED

19
00:02:40,825 --> 00:02:42,065
At this stage of the case,

20
00:02:43,065 --> 00:02:44,185
there's a strong chance Mei's accomplice

21
00:02:44,265 --> 00:02:45,985
has taken the four children
out of Weiyang.

22
00:02:46,065 --> 00:02:49,185
And right now, we still have no new leads.

23
00:02:51,145 --> 00:02:53,425
Tomorrow is the last day
of the seven-day deadline.

24
00:02:54,025 --> 00:02:58,025
How about we ask Director Zou
for two more days?

25
00:03:05,865 --> 00:03:07,305
I made a promise.

26
00:03:08,145 --> 00:03:09,065
Don't be discouraged.

27
00:03:10,145 --> 00:03:11,385
Even if we miss the deadline,

28
00:03:11,465 --> 00:03:12,865
I'll take responsibility.

29
00:03:13,465 --> 00:03:16,185
You all keep looking for the children.
Don't stop until they're found.

30
00:03:27,105 --> 00:03:28,865
If only we had listened to Xiaohe earlier

31
00:03:28,945 --> 00:03:30,705
and focused all our manpower
on investigating Yuanlongli,

32
00:03:30,785 --> 00:03:33,225
maybe there would be no regrets.

33
00:03:45,865 --> 00:03:49,025
There's no sign at all
of Mei's accomplice or the four children.

34
00:03:49,105 --> 00:03:51,825
If we keep digging around this place,
does it still mean anything?

35
00:03:52,545 --> 00:03:56,665
No. 1316 shows no signs
of anyone living there after Mei died.

36
00:03:56,745 --> 00:03:58,425
But the kidnappings kept happening,

37
00:03:58,505 --> 00:04:00,305
using the same old method.

38
00:04:00,385 --> 00:04:01,945
What does that tell us?

39
00:04:06,625 --> 00:04:08,065
Hey, you.

40
00:04:08,625 --> 00:04:09,465
What is that?

41
00:04:09,545 --> 00:04:13,265
A strategic meeting needs to come up
with a real-time battle plan or something.

42
00:04:13,345 --> 00:04:15,145
Go do your thing. Stay out of the way.

43
00:04:15,905 --> 00:04:17,064
Alright.

44
00:04:22,785 --> 00:04:24,145
Where was I?

45
00:04:25,065 --> 00:04:26,185
What does that tell us?

46
00:04:27,585 --> 00:04:31,265
To snatch children away
from a crowded and exposed place

47
00:04:31,345 --> 00:04:35,105
suggests a hidden route.

48
00:04:39,505 --> 00:04:40,465
A hidden route?

49
00:04:41,145 --> 00:04:43,705
Captain Qu has turned
this place upside down.

50
00:04:43,785 --> 00:04:45,465
We're not checking
the internet café today.

51
00:04:45,545 --> 00:04:47,425
We're checking the ways out of it.

52
00:04:48,545 --> 00:04:51,625
First, check the B1 route.

53
00:04:51,705 --> 00:04:54,545
Second, check the garage exit route.

54
00:04:55,065 --> 00:04:56,945
Same method as before. Block both ends.

55
00:05:03,425 --> 00:05:04,705
You're not eating your instant noodles?

56
00:05:08,225 --> 00:05:13,945
NEW YORK BLOCK

57
00:05:16,185 --> 00:05:17,985
NEED GLASSES? FIND US AT OPTICAL
INSTALLMENT PLANS, CREDIT CARDS

58
00:05:22,345 --> 00:05:24,705
-Are you a police officer?
-Yes.

59
00:05:24,785 --> 00:05:26,865
Last week, I told you
my platform truck was stolen.

60
00:05:27,625 --> 00:05:29,425
Can you do something about it?

61
00:05:29,505 --> 00:05:31,065
When are you sending someone
to look into it?

62
00:05:31,705 --> 00:05:34,985
Mister, we're working on a case.
I'll help you find it once we're done.

63
00:05:35,865 --> 00:05:37,625
What did the platform truck look like?

64
00:05:38,705 --> 00:05:40,065
That kind. Blue in color.

65
00:05:57,505 --> 00:05:58,745
Mr. He, I'll do it.

66
00:05:58,825 --> 00:06:00,305
What's on it?

67
00:06:02,425 --> 00:06:04,385
Are you done? I'm about to suffocate.

68
00:06:07,545 --> 00:06:10,665
I get it now. The trafficker
knocked the children out,

69
00:06:10,745 --> 00:06:12,265
then used the platform truck
to haul them out.

70
00:06:12,345 --> 00:06:14,185
Search both directions.

71
00:06:14,265 --> 00:06:15,785
See if there are any clues.

72
00:06:15,865 --> 00:06:16,905
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN
GARAGE EXIT, NO ENTRY

73
00:06:16,985 --> 00:06:18,305
LASER ENGRAVING, CUSTOM GIFTS

74
00:06:18,385 --> 00:06:19,985
There should've been a car outside
waiting to pick them up.

75
00:06:20,065 --> 00:06:22,225
It's not likely the person
dragged the platform truck around.

76
00:06:22,305 --> 00:06:24,025
Most likely that's what happened.

77
00:06:24,105 --> 00:06:26,025
But there's still
a small chance otherwise.

78
00:06:27,505 --> 00:06:30,785
Mr. Ran once told me
that out of 10,000 possibilities,

79
00:06:30,865 --> 00:06:33,385
if you miss one, you might miss the truth.

80
00:06:35,145 --> 00:06:36,825
Bai, Hui. You two take this side.
I'll check over there.

81
00:06:36,905 --> 00:06:37,825
Okay.

82
00:06:44,985 --> 00:06:48,065
You can always count on Ran.

83
00:07:07,105 --> 00:07:08,025
Captain Ran,

84
00:07:08,105 --> 00:07:09,865
a case was transferred over
from Jiangwan Road Police Station.

85
00:07:09,945 --> 00:07:12,025
Last night, a woman
was attacked on the street.

86
00:07:12,105 --> 00:07:14,305
She was hit in the back of the head
with a blunt object.

87
00:07:17,065 --> 00:07:17,905
CRIME SCENE PHOTO

88
00:07:17,985 --> 00:07:19,345
There were no witnesses at the scene,

89
00:07:19,425 --> 00:07:21,185
and no clues were found either.

90
00:07:26,465 --> 00:07:27,705
THIS WOMAN'S NAME IS ZHAO HONGMEI

91
00:07:47,825 --> 00:07:50,985
The patient was struck in the head
with a blunt object,

92
00:07:51,065 --> 00:07:52,905
causing multiple brain bleeds.

93
00:07:53,425 --> 00:07:56,505
Even if she survives,
the aftereffects will be severe.

94
00:07:56,585 --> 00:07:59,705
In milder cases, she may be unable
to take care of herself.

95
00:07:59,785 --> 00:08:02,265
In serious cases,
it could result in brain death.

96
00:08:02,345 --> 00:08:03,745
That's the overall situation.

97
00:08:04,385 --> 00:08:05,865
Alright. Thank you.

98
00:08:09,345 --> 00:08:13,465
Sir, does Zhao Hongmei's situation
remind you of anything?

99
00:08:18,465 --> 00:08:20,145
Can you tell me
what happened to your head first?

100
00:08:20,225 --> 00:08:21,825
Someone's trying to kill me.

101
00:08:21,905 --> 00:08:25,105
He wanted to smash my head
in broad daylight.

102
00:08:25,905 --> 00:08:27,465
You mean the same method?

103
00:08:28,265 --> 00:08:31,345
The attacker who assaulted
Wu Shanlong is the same person?

104
00:08:35,144 --> 00:08:37,264
Zhao Hongmei and Wu Shanlong's
mutual social connections

105
00:08:37,345 --> 00:08:39,225
are mainly linked to Hongyun Huihuang.

106
00:08:39,825 --> 00:08:41,385
Wu Shanlong is the second-largest
shareholder there.

107
00:08:41,465 --> 00:08:42,985
Should we go check it out?

108
00:08:45,625 --> 00:08:47,105
What is it?

109
00:08:47,905 --> 00:08:49,985
A lot of things line up now.

110
00:08:50,825 --> 00:08:52,345
Wu Shanlong isn't smart.

111
00:08:52,425 --> 00:08:54,385
But Zhao Hongmei is different.

112
00:08:56,545 --> 00:08:58,465
The money Zhao Hongmei used
to open Hongyun Huihuang

113
00:08:58,545 --> 00:08:59,985
was invested by Wu Shanlong.

114
00:09:00,065 --> 00:09:01,065
So,

115
00:09:01,665 --> 00:09:05,665
it's very likely that she and Wu Shanlong
ganged up to scam Song Qingsong.

116
00:09:06,945 --> 00:09:09,585
Do you think it's possible
that Song Qingsong's back?

117
00:09:11,545 --> 00:09:13,985
A wanted fugitive would only risk
coming back to the country

118
00:09:14,585 --> 00:09:16,465
for a serious reason.

119
00:09:16,985 --> 00:09:18,905
Most likely, he came back for revenge.

120
00:09:20,225 --> 00:09:22,105
Any clues at the scene
where Zhao Hongmei was attacked?

121
00:09:23,065 --> 00:09:25,905
I checked the photos taken by the station.
Nothing turned up.

122
00:09:32,585 --> 00:09:34,545
No clues from Zhao Hongmei's side,

123
00:09:35,425 --> 00:09:36,305
but there's something
on Wu Shanlong's end.

124
00:09:37,665 --> 00:09:38,865
Wu Shanlong?

125
00:09:39,385 --> 00:09:42,425
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH WEINAN POLICE STATION

126
00:09:46,385 --> 00:09:47,745
Officer Ran. Careful, it's hot.

127
00:09:47,825 --> 00:09:49,025
Thank you.

128
00:09:49,545 --> 00:09:51,585
-You don't have to do that.
-Officer He, have some tea.

129
00:09:54,625 --> 00:09:56,905
Officer He, it's been a while.

130
00:09:56,985 --> 00:09:57,945
You've put on some weight.

131
00:09:58,025 --> 00:09:59,025
JUSTICE FOR UNPAID WAGES
DUTIFUL AND RIGHTEOUS

132
00:09:59,105 --> 00:09:59,985
Happy weight.

133
00:10:01,625 --> 00:10:02,905
Officer He, Officer Ran.

134
00:10:02,985 --> 00:10:05,585
This is the evidence Wu Shanlong
brought in when he filed the report.

135
00:10:09,345 --> 00:10:10,505
PROPERTY OF EVIDENCE

136
00:10:19,905 --> 00:10:23,585
WEIYANG BUS STATION

137
00:10:23,665 --> 00:10:25,705
WEIYANG BUS GROUP

138
00:10:36,545 --> 00:10:39,785
Never seen it. We don't
have wrenches like that here.

139
00:10:39,865 --> 00:10:41,225
SKILLED AND TRUE, FAST AND FAIR

140
00:10:44,145 --> 00:10:45,345
Thank you.

141
00:10:52,305 --> 00:10:53,305
Excuse me.

142
00:10:53,825 --> 00:10:54,825
Please take a look.

143
00:10:54,905 --> 00:10:56,465
Have you seen a wrench like this before?

144
00:11:02,945 --> 00:11:04,625
WEIYANG BUS STATION

145
00:11:05,665 --> 00:11:07,225
Isn't this the tool
the unit used to issue to everyone

146
00:11:07,305 --> 00:11:08,865
when we first started working?

147
00:11:11,145 --> 00:11:12,225
You're right.

148
00:11:12,305 --> 00:11:14,705
A couple of years ago,
the fleet was merged into the company.

149
00:11:14,785 --> 00:11:16,705
That whole batch of tools
was phased out at once.

150
00:11:17,985 --> 00:11:18,785
Where did they end up?

151
00:11:18,865 --> 00:11:22,145
RECYCLE

152
00:11:24,465 --> 00:11:26,465
Excuse me. Is your boss in?

153
00:11:26,545 --> 00:11:28,545
-Inside.
-Thank you.

154
00:11:32,545 --> 00:11:33,705
This should be the place.

155
00:11:36,265 --> 00:11:38,825
Excuse me, sir.
I need to ask you something.

156
00:11:40,705 --> 00:11:42,225
Have you seen this wrench before?

157
00:11:43,265 --> 00:11:44,105
No.

158
00:11:49,305 --> 00:11:51,425
-Have you seen this person?
-No.

159
00:11:56,625 --> 00:11:57,865
POLICE RAN FANGXU

160
00:12:00,305 --> 00:12:01,785
I'm a law-abiding citizen.

161
00:12:01,865 --> 00:12:03,705
Everything I do is above board.

162
00:12:09,345 --> 00:12:11,465
Above board, eh?

163
00:12:12,505 --> 00:12:14,785
Above board.

164
00:12:31,785 --> 00:12:32,945
Above board.

165
00:12:33,465 --> 00:12:35,625
IRON CASTING

166
00:12:36,225 --> 00:12:38,665
Officer, I honestly
have no idea about this.

167
00:12:38,745 --> 00:12:41,225
It must've been one of my workers
who bought it without thinking.

168
00:12:41,305 --> 00:12:43,425
I'll contact the city management team
right away and return it to the owner.

169
00:12:46,745 --> 00:12:48,425
Do you recognize this man now?

170
00:12:49,585 --> 00:12:51,505
Looks a bit like the one
from the cement factory.

171
00:12:51,585 --> 00:12:53,065
Song Qingsong.

172
00:12:54,105 --> 00:12:56,545
But too many people come and go here.

173
00:12:56,625 --> 00:12:59,025
After all this time,
I really can't remember.

174
00:13:00,625 --> 00:13:01,745
Over here!

175
00:13:01,825 --> 00:13:02,905
Sir!

176
00:13:04,425 --> 00:13:05,265
Sir!

177
00:13:05,345 --> 00:13:06,905
Help!

178
00:13:07,625 --> 00:13:09,425
Ran! What happened?

179
00:13:09,505 --> 00:13:11,185
Pull me up!

180
00:13:11,265 --> 00:13:13,665
Ran, what were you doing up there?

181
00:13:15,065 --> 00:13:16,865
-What happened?
-Sir!

182
00:13:16,945 --> 00:13:18,065
Pull me up!

183
00:13:18,145 --> 00:13:19,265
How did this happen?

184
00:13:22,265 --> 00:13:24,625
-Why did you climb up here?
-I got stuck.

185
00:13:25,985 --> 00:13:26,985
That's dangerous.

186
00:13:28,065 --> 00:13:29,505
I got stuck right here.

187
00:13:35,465 --> 00:13:36,545
Are you alright?

188
00:13:38,385 --> 00:13:40,145
What are you holding?

189
00:13:42,265 --> 00:13:43,665
Here.

190
00:13:44,185 --> 00:13:45,905
-What is this?
-Look here.

191
00:13:48,225 --> 00:13:49,665
QINGSONG CEMENT

192
00:14:27,145 --> 00:14:28,105
What's wrong?

193
00:14:28,785 --> 00:14:30,425
Missing Ran?

194
00:14:35,265 --> 00:14:37,185
There are so many people in the force,

195
00:14:37,905 --> 00:14:39,465
but he's still the one
everyone respects most.

196
00:14:41,785 --> 00:14:44,905
If he were here, this case
would've been solved by now.

197
00:14:49,305 --> 00:14:51,865
He's not all-knowing.

198
00:14:51,945 --> 00:14:56,585
He made mistakes on his first case too
and failed as well.

199
00:14:59,905 --> 00:15:02,145
Hopefully, my first case…

200
00:15:02,865 --> 00:15:05,505
<i>Mr. He, we found a syringe</i>
<i>by the roadside.</i>

201
00:15:24,385 --> 00:15:26,465
Han Zi'ang had two needle marks
on his arm.

202
00:15:27,905 --> 00:15:31,345
Could it be he was drugged
in the internet café and dragged out,

203
00:15:31,945 --> 00:15:33,105
then woke up from the bumps
while on the platform truck?

204
00:15:33,185 --> 00:15:35,145
So the trafficker gave him another shot.

205
00:15:36,305 --> 00:15:37,585
But he kept struggling,

206
00:15:37,665 --> 00:15:39,985
and the syringe
got knocked loose and fell here.

207
00:15:40,585 --> 00:15:42,505
The trafficker was afraid
he would cry for help,

208
00:15:42,585 --> 00:15:43,745
so they knocked him out.

209
00:15:43,825 --> 00:15:45,785
That's how Han Zi'ang
got the injury on his head.

210
00:15:46,825 --> 00:15:49,505
But Han Zi'ang was found
inside New York Block.

211
00:15:49,585 --> 00:15:50,705
How do we explain that?

212
00:15:52,025 --> 00:15:53,985
Why would the trafficker
use a platform truck

213
00:15:54,065 --> 00:15:55,665
to drag him that far?

214
00:15:57,865 --> 00:16:01,265
Because the underground garage has stairs
leading to B1 of New York Block.

215
00:16:01,345 --> 00:16:02,585
The platform truck couldn't go up.

216
00:16:16,465 --> 00:16:18,545
This road goes straight
to the main gate of Yuanlongli.

217
00:16:19,065 --> 00:16:22,025
Han Zi'ang was brought back
into Yuanlongli.

218
00:16:26,145 --> 00:16:29,825
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

219
00:16:39,345 --> 00:16:41,225
No need to ask.
Those cameras broke long ago.

220
00:17:15,825 --> 00:17:17,305
On the day Han Zi'ang injured a man,

221
00:17:17,905 --> 00:17:19,464
no one pulling a platform truck was seen.

222
00:17:22,224 --> 00:17:23,464
Check the day before.

223
00:17:34,185 --> 00:17:35,145
Hold on.

224
00:17:36,185 --> 00:17:38,185
This person is a resident here.

225
00:17:39,145 --> 00:17:40,385
Wearing a cap.

226
00:17:40,465 --> 00:17:41,465
Can't see the face clearly.

227
00:17:53,945 --> 00:17:54,905
Mister.

228
00:17:54,985 --> 00:17:55,825
POLICE

229
00:17:55,905 --> 00:17:57,985
Your wound is serious.
Come with me and get it treated, alright?

230
00:17:59,025 --> 00:18:00,545
Can you hear me?

231
00:18:01,105 --> 00:18:02,105
Mister?

232
00:19:42,025 --> 00:19:43,105
Wait.

233
00:19:43,945 --> 00:19:48,025
The layout for No. 16
should have another room.

234
00:20:16,745 --> 00:20:17,825
Careful!

235
00:20:19,665 --> 00:20:21,385
They're a bit triggered right now.

236
00:20:26,265 --> 00:20:27,425
Hush.

237
00:20:31,865 --> 00:20:33,265
Ponies,

238
00:20:33,865 --> 00:20:35,105
Dad is home.

239
00:20:53,105 --> 00:20:54,865
POLICE

240
00:20:56,985 --> 00:20:57,905
How are things?

241
00:20:57,985 --> 00:20:59,225
Initial diagnosis says they're fine.

242
00:20:59,305 --> 00:21:00,465
We'll take them to the hospital now.

243
00:21:00,545 --> 00:21:01,665
Alright.

244
00:21:04,745 --> 00:21:05,585
Get him in the car.

245
00:21:10,185 --> 00:21:11,145
Captain Qu.

246
00:21:11,225 --> 00:21:12,785
-Captain Qu.
-Bai, Hui.

247
00:21:13,305 --> 00:21:15,345
You two did a great job.

248
00:21:15,945 --> 00:21:16,785
No.

249
00:21:16,865 --> 00:21:18,545
-We were just backing them up.
-Right.

250
00:21:18,625 --> 00:21:21,465
The credit should go to Mr. He, Xiaohe
and Zhong who were guiding us.

251
00:21:22,105 --> 00:21:23,985
The real credit goes to you young people.

252
00:21:24,785 --> 00:21:27,985
Old folks shouldn't be stuck in old ways.

253
00:21:28,065 --> 00:21:29,985
We should trust the younger generation

254
00:21:30,065 --> 00:21:32,305
and give them a chance to shine.

255
00:21:32,385 --> 00:21:35,505
Back then, Ran was just a fresh graduate.

256
00:21:35,585 --> 00:21:38,585
As his mentor, I gave him
full trust and support.

257
00:21:39,185 --> 00:21:40,145
You've got that backward, haven't you?

258
00:21:40,225 --> 00:21:42,305
Who was supporting whom?

259
00:21:42,385 --> 00:21:43,585
Qu Dahai,

260
00:21:44,225 --> 00:21:47,025
forget everyone else, just between us two,

261
00:21:47,105 --> 00:21:50,705
who's better at cracking big cases
is pretty obvious, right?

262
00:21:52,105 --> 00:21:54,105
Isn't everything you know
learned from Captain Ran?

263
00:21:56,185 --> 00:21:57,705
Come on. I'm treating you all
to some good food.

264
00:21:57,785 --> 00:21:59,745
-Alright.
-Thank you, Mr. He.

265
00:22:44,545 --> 00:22:48,305
CAROUSEL'S DEAD HEAT

266
00:23:51,985 --> 00:23:53,025
<i>Keyboard,</i>

267
00:23:54,305 --> 00:23:58,145
<i>you're surely going to become</i>
<i>the best keyboard player.</i>

268
00:24:24,145 --> 00:24:25,265
Peng Dachuang.

269
00:24:25,865 --> 00:24:27,345
The facts are clear,

270
00:24:28,305 --> 00:24:30,345
and the chain of evidence
is complete. I advise you…

271
00:24:30,425 --> 00:24:32,065
Can I have a cigarette?

272
00:24:46,025 --> 00:24:49,905
-I advise you…
-You attacked police officers.

273
00:24:49,985 --> 00:24:52,025
-That adds another charge.
-Behave yourself.

274
00:24:56,345 --> 00:24:57,225
Are you alright?

275
00:25:02,625 --> 00:25:03,665
Captain Qu.

276
00:25:07,825 --> 00:25:09,225
Get your wound treated.

277
00:25:11,025 --> 00:25:12,745
-What is it?
-Captain Qu,

278
00:25:12,825 --> 00:25:14,025
can I try?

279
00:25:15,785 --> 00:25:16,625
Have you interrogated a suspect before?

280
00:25:18,585 --> 00:25:19,905
No.

281
00:25:19,985 --> 00:25:22,425
But I'm good friends
with Peng Dachuang's son.

282
00:25:30,345 --> 00:25:31,665
You have half an hour.

283
00:25:36,825 --> 00:25:38,065
We'll be waiting next door.

284
00:25:38,145 --> 00:25:39,745
If anything happens, wave to us.

285
00:25:40,585 --> 00:25:41,425
Okay.

286
00:25:54,265 --> 00:25:55,465
-Get lost!
-I'm here.

287
00:25:55,545 --> 00:25:56,625
I'm here.

288
00:25:57,825 --> 00:25:59,065
Why are you so slow with homework?

289
00:25:59,145 --> 00:26:00,585
We already came up with hundreds of names.

290
00:26:00,665 --> 00:26:03,185
I thought of one.
Let's call it Carousel Band.

291
00:26:03,265 --> 00:26:04,425
Isn't it cool?

292
00:26:05,185 --> 00:26:07,065
Are you advertising your dad's bar?

293
00:26:07,145 --> 00:26:10,985
Everyone knows your dad's bar
is called Carousel's Dead Heat.

294
00:26:11,065 --> 00:26:13,745
Then do you know
why my dad's bar is called Carousel?

295
00:26:14,785 --> 00:26:17,305
Because my nickname is Pony.

296
00:26:17,385 --> 00:26:20,585
My dad named the bar that
because he knew I loved carousels.

297
00:26:20,665 --> 00:26:23,305
I don't believe it. He's so harsh on you.

298
00:26:23,385 --> 00:26:24,585
Pony?

299
00:26:25,425 --> 00:26:26,705
Pony?

300
00:26:26,785 --> 00:26:27,985
Pony…

301
00:27:11,665 --> 00:27:15,105
Peng Dachuang, why did you kidnap
those children?

302
00:27:24,545 --> 00:27:25,665
<i>Was it because of…</i>

303
00:27:26,545 --> 00:27:27,385
Pony?

304
00:27:28,145 --> 00:27:29,265
CAROUSEL'S DEAD HEAT

305
00:27:58,185 --> 00:27:59,625
Pony…

306
00:28:01,505 --> 00:28:03,305
Pony…

307
00:28:07,025 --> 00:28:09,145
My Pony…

308
00:28:10,065 --> 00:28:12,585
Pony…

309
00:28:15,225 --> 00:28:17,625
The ambulance is here! Make way! Hurry!

310
00:28:17,705 --> 00:28:19,025
What happened?

311
00:28:19,105 --> 00:28:20,465
What happened here?

312
00:28:21,745 --> 00:28:23,865
-Sir, step back.
-Back up a little.

313
00:28:23,945 --> 00:28:26,305
-Sir. Sir.
-Sir.

314
00:28:26,385 --> 00:28:28,785
Get lost!

315
00:28:28,865 --> 00:28:30,745
Get lost!

316
00:28:32,265 --> 00:28:35,225
Pony…

317
00:28:36,705 --> 00:28:37,825
Mr. Peng,

318
00:28:38,905 --> 00:28:41,905
the girl next to Pony in this photo is me.

319
00:28:44,305 --> 00:28:46,585
Pony was my best friend.

320
00:28:46,665 --> 00:28:49,185
I understand your pain.

321
00:28:49,265 --> 00:28:51,345
I'm sorry that he died.

322
00:28:51,425 --> 00:28:53,825
Who told you he's dead?
Who told you he's dead?

323
00:28:53,905 --> 00:28:55,785
I see him every day.

324
00:28:55,865 --> 00:28:57,585
I see him every day.

325
00:28:57,665 --> 00:29:01,465
-Dad, I'm hiding now.
-I'm coming to catch you.

326
00:29:05,545 --> 00:29:06,625
Pony,

327
00:29:06,705 --> 00:29:08,465
-found you.
-Dad!

328
00:29:08,545 --> 00:29:09,785
What are you doing?

329
00:29:14,025 --> 00:29:16,905
Those ponies are naughty.
They never want to come home.

330
00:29:30,785 --> 00:29:34,025
Later… Later, they told me

331
00:29:34,105 --> 00:29:36,745
Yuanlongli was going to be demolished
and told me to move out.

332
00:29:46,105 --> 00:29:47,065
DEMOLITION

333
00:29:48,145 --> 00:29:49,625
<i>If I moved away,</i>

334
00:29:50,745 --> 00:29:52,265
<i>how would Pony find his way home?</i>

335
00:30:33,065 --> 00:30:34,185
Who are you looking for?

336
00:30:37,785 --> 00:30:39,625
Is someone in your house beating a child?

337
00:30:40,225 --> 00:30:41,305
There's no child in my house.

338
00:30:45,625 --> 00:30:46,545
What are you up to?

339
00:30:47,305 --> 00:30:48,305
It's in your house.

340
00:30:50,505 --> 00:30:52,585
Are you insane?

341
00:30:54,945 --> 00:30:56,345
Get out of here.

342
00:30:56,945 --> 00:30:58,905
I'm calling the police. Leave now.

343
00:31:05,945 --> 00:31:07,345
Move aside!

344
00:31:14,385 --> 00:31:17,385
Please. Please. Please.

345
00:31:17,465 --> 00:31:18,665
It's not what you think.

346
00:31:18,745 --> 00:31:20,465
I'll send him home right now.

347
00:31:20,545 --> 00:31:22,185
As if I'd believe you.

348
00:31:22,265 --> 00:31:23,665
You're a trafficker.

349
00:31:23,745 --> 00:31:24,985
Weren't you going to call the police?

350
00:31:25,065 --> 00:31:26,905
Fine. I'll call right now.

351
00:31:26,985 --> 00:31:28,505
Please. Don't call the police.

352
00:31:28,585 --> 00:31:29,345
-Get off.
-Don't call the police.

353
00:31:32,545 --> 00:31:33,945
Boy, don't be scared.

354
00:31:34,025 --> 00:31:34,985
I'll get you out of here.

355
00:31:35,665 --> 00:31:38,345
Don't be scared.
I'll take you home right now.

356
00:31:40,905 --> 00:31:42,305
Don't be scared.

357
00:32:08,145 --> 00:32:10,545
Help! Help!

358
00:32:10,625 --> 00:32:12,185
Help!

359
00:32:12,785 --> 00:32:14,665
Help… Help…

360
00:32:56,265 --> 00:32:57,385
Hang in there.

361
00:32:58,545 --> 00:32:59,745
I know it hurts.

362
00:32:59,825 --> 00:33:00,905
Hang in there.

363
00:33:04,865 --> 00:33:07,425
Come. Let me untie the rope for you.

364
00:33:12,225 --> 00:33:13,505
Does it hurt?

365
00:33:15,825 --> 00:33:17,185
Human traffickers deserve to die.

366
00:33:17,265 --> 00:33:18,105
They deserve to die.

367
00:33:18,185 --> 00:33:20,305
They all deserve to die.
They all deserve to die.

368
00:33:20,385 --> 00:33:24,105
Why did that boy
go to your house afterward?

369
00:33:35,865 --> 00:33:37,785
Pony told me

370
00:33:38,865 --> 00:33:41,305
his parents fought every day.

371
00:33:42,585 --> 00:33:43,905
He didn't want to go home.

372
00:33:45,305 --> 00:33:48,145
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY, WEIYANG CITY

373
00:34:05,305 --> 00:34:07,545
CEMENT FACTORY
PAY UP, DEBT MUST BE PAID

374
00:34:07,625 --> 00:34:08,585
Do you have a saw in your car?

375
00:34:18,465 --> 00:34:24,744
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY, WEIYANG CITY

376
00:34:26,225 --> 00:34:27,344
Can you do this?

377
00:34:27,425 --> 00:34:30,145
-If not, come down.
-I'm fine.

378
00:34:31,985 --> 00:34:33,585
Sir. Over here.

379
00:34:35,304 --> 00:34:36,665
What's going on?

380
00:34:37,744 --> 00:34:39,065
I can't free up a hand.

381
00:34:43,505 --> 00:34:44,744
Hold the bag for me.

382
00:34:53,585 --> 00:34:54,625
Let's split up and search.

383
00:34:54,705 --> 00:34:56,344
-You go that side. I'll go this side.
-Alright.

384
00:36:00,465 --> 00:36:01,305
How is it?

385
00:36:02,465 --> 00:36:04,345
-Nothing on my side.
-Same here.

386
00:36:06,425 --> 00:36:07,825
Let's check over there.

387
00:36:09,985 --> 00:36:11,185
Wait.

388
00:36:15,825 --> 00:36:18,425
QINGSONG CEMENT

389
00:36:18,505 --> 00:36:20,225
Why is smoke coming from up there?

390
00:36:22,945 --> 00:36:23,945
Let's go check it out.

391
00:36:25,425 --> 00:36:26,665
Careful, sir.

392
00:36:28,225 --> 00:36:29,905
Slow down.

393
00:36:31,265 --> 00:36:33,025
-Sir.
-It's pitch black.

394
00:36:33,105 --> 00:36:35,865
Climbing stairs is good
for your three highs.

395
00:36:35,945 --> 00:36:37,105
As if.

396
00:36:37,665 --> 00:36:39,025
Slow down.

397
00:36:40,825 --> 00:36:42,985
Climbing stairs helps lose belly fat.

398
00:36:43,505 --> 00:36:45,425
I have no belly fat.

399
00:36:45,505 --> 00:36:47,865
When I was young,
my waist was slimmer than yours.

400
00:37:06,225 --> 00:37:07,865
Sir.

401
00:37:31,905 --> 00:37:32,945
Song Qingsong.

402
00:37:36,505 --> 00:37:38,025
Long time no see, officers.

403
00:37:39,345 --> 00:37:41,425
Why are you back in Weiyang?

404
00:37:49,625 --> 00:37:51,785
Have a seat. Let's sit and talk.

405
00:37:54,105 --> 00:37:56,305
I haven't met anyone since I've been here.

406
00:38:00,345 --> 00:38:02,345
You want to ask about
Xu Meng and her father, right?

407
00:38:02,425 --> 00:38:04,665
And Wu Shanlong and Zhao Hongmei.

408
00:38:06,825 --> 00:38:07,785
Let's do it one by one.

409
00:38:09,305 --> 00:38:11,545
About that young woman
at the foot massage shop,

410
00:38:12,145 --> 00:38:14,265
it's true I paid Wu Shanlong
to get rid of her.

411
00:38:16,625 --> 00:38:18,385
Back then, Wu Shanlong told me

412
00:38:18,465 --> 00:38:21,265
Cripple Du had someone
snatch the body away.

413
00:38:22,465 --> 00:38:26,545
That scoundrel knew
Cripple Du and me were enemies.

414
00:38:27,145 --> 00:38:28,745
But the world is small.

415
00:38:29,265 --> 00:38:31,425
I ran into him when I was overseas.

416
00:38:32,305 --> 00:38:34,025
He had fled too.

417
00:38:37,465 --> 00:38:39,545
Where is Xu Meng's body?

418
00:38:41,385 --> 00:38:43,945
Wu Shanlong was a coward.

419
00:38:44,545 --> 00:38:46,665
He took photos.
He definitely destroyed them.

420
00:38:47,825 --> 00:38:50,185
Why did you go after Zhao Hongmei?

421
00:38:51,665 --> 00:38:53,105
That wretched woman

422
00:38:53,185 --> 00:38:55,785
ganged up with Wu Shanlong
and swindled me out of my money.

423
00:38:55,865 --> 00:38:58,825
I worked half my life
to build that factory.

424
00:38:58,905 --> 00:39:00,465
The pair of them ruined it.

425
00:39:00,545 --> 00:39:02,545
On top of that, they owed
the workers a lot of money.

426
00:39:02,625 --> 00:39:04,825
Those who had followed me
for over 20 years

427
00:39:04,905 --> 00:39:07,065
couldn't even afford medical treatment.

428
00:39:09,865 --> 00:39:12,105
That's why you assaulted Wu Shanlong too?

429
00:39:13,185 --> 00:39:14,825
What I regret most is going soft

430
00:39:17,105 --> 00:39:19,225
and not killing him.

431
00:39:47,105 --> 00:39:48,145
Song,

432
00:39:49,905 --> 00:39:52,025
life hasn't been easy for you
these past years, has it?

433
00:39:56,745 --> 00:39:58,585
When I first ran off,

434
00:39:59,465 --> 00:40:02,745
I thought about bringing
my wife and child over.

435
00:40:03,265 --> 00:40:05,065
But I couldn't reach them at all.

436
00:40:05,825 --> 00:40:07,345
Later, I found out

437
00:40:07,865 --> 00:40:11,665
that woman had already sold the house
and run off with my child.

438
00:40:19,265 --> 00:40:20,745
The money I took with me

439
00:40:21,905 --> 00:40:23,465
was gone in less than two years.

440
00:40:24,745 --> 00:40:27,545
I couldn't speak their language,
and I was undocumented.

441
00:40:28,425 --> 00:40:30,545
I could only do construction work
and make very little money.

442
00:40:33,385 --> 00:40:34,985
You would never guess it.

443
00:40:35,505 --> 00:40:36,505
In the end,

444
00:40:37,265 --> 00:40:39,385
it was Cripple Du who gave me money,

445
00:40:39,905 --> 00:40:42,225
so I could sneak back here
and get my revenge.

446
00:40:48,505 --> 00:40:52,105
We had been enemies half our lives,
but he actually gave me money.

447
00:40:54,985 --> 00:40:56,225
As for what I owed the workers,

448
00:40:57,185 --> 00:40:59,865
I sold components from the factory
to pay them back.

449
00:41:00,705 --> 00:41:03,345
Now my revenge is done.
I don't care about anything anymore.

450
00:41:04,505 --> 00:41:07,585
I admit everything I did.

451
00:41:09,025 --> 00:41:10,065
Come on.

452
00:41:22,105 --> 00:41:23,025
We'll do that after we go downstairs.

453
00:41:25,305 --> 00:41:26,705
Give me a moment to tidy up.

454
00:41:49,465 --> 00:41:50,465
Thank you.

